# Ao Lai

id:world-ao-lai a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ao Lai" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4871520aab6c2> ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "The system takes in both components of Gamma Leporis, 29 ly out. Bound to B because that is the one the add-on carries — the real star catalogue here has only A — so the marker sits on the companion while the system is both. Held by the Primate Provolution Institute: small, independent, and not one of the empires. The add-on's own file for this system names three Earth-like worlds around B — Hope, Faith and Charity — which is finer than this map goes." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

